tion_note":"依〈三代世表〉本欄世系與《五帝本紀》《夏本紀》《殷本紀》《周本紀》暫定同指；不跨國別套用同名。","table_id":"shiji-013","table_fragment_id":"shiji-013-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-013-t1-r021","table_cell_id":"shiji-013-t1-r021-c00","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-013","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-013","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-013","source_revision":"2606991","kind":"table_person_mention","quote":"帝發"}],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:p034","text":"孔甲崩，子帝皋立。帝皋崩，子帝發立。帝發崩，子帝履癸立，是爲桀。帝桀之時，自孔甲以來而諸侯多畔夏，桀不務德而武傷百姓，百姓弗堪。迺召湯而囚之夏臺，已而釋之。湯修德，諸侯皆歸湯，湯遂率兵以伐夏桀。桀走鳴條，遂放而死。桀謂人曰：「吾悔不遂殺湯於夏臺，使至此。」湯乃踐天子位，代夏朝天下。湯封夏之後，至周封於杞也。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m034-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孔甲","kind":"person","person_id":"bit_d2r_h4o","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m034-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"帝皋","kind":"person","person_id":"cm7_og0_w7q","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m034-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"帝皋","kind":"person","person_id":"cm7_og0_w7q","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m034-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"帝發","kind":"person","person_id":"u7i_t8j_qye","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m034-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"帝發","kind":"person","person_id":"u7i_t8j_qye","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m034-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"帝履癸","kind":"person","person_id":"65f_dvi_ljt","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m034-0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"桀","kind":"person","person_id":"65f_dvi_ljt","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m034-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"帝桀","kind":"person","person_id":"65f_dvi_ljt","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m034-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"孔甲","kind":"person","person_id":"bit_d2r_h4o","sta